00:00:00,330 --> 00:00:03,010
(Transcribed by TurboScribe.ai. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) When I spoke to you last at Christmas,

2
00:00:04,230 --> 00:00:10,230
I asked you all, whatever your religion, to

3
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:12,850
pray for me on the day of my

4
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:17,870
coronation, to pray that God would give me

5
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:22,150
wisdom and strength to carry out the promises

6
00:00:22,150 --> 00:00:24,750
that I should then be making.

7
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:31,800
Throughout this memorable day, I have been uplifted

8
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:36,140
and sustained by the knowledge that your thoughts

9
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:38,400
and prayers were with me.

10
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:43,680
I have been aware all the time that

11
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:48,380
my peoples, spread far and wide throughout every

12
00:00:48,380 --> 00:00:52,600
continent and ocean in the world, were united

13
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:56,280
to support me in the task to which

14
00:00:56,280 --> 00:01:00,460
I have now been dedicated with such solemnity.

15
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:06,200
Many thousands of you came to London from

16
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:09,840
all parts of the commonwealth and empire to

17
00:01:09,840 --> 00:01:13,600
join in the ceremony, but I have been

18
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:17,560
conscious too of the millions of others who

19
00:01:17,560 --> 00:01:20,800
have shared in it by means of wireless

20
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:23,520
or television in their homes.

21
00:01:24,580 --> 00:01:28,780
All of you, near or far, have been

22
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:30,800
united in one purpose.

23
00:01:31,940 --> 00:01:34,900
It is hard for me to find words

24
00:01:34,900 --> 00:01:37,580
in which to tell you of the strength

25
00:01:37,580 --> 00:01:40,240
which this knowledge has given me.

26
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:45,520
The ceremonies you have seen today are ancient,

27
00:01:46,300 --> 00:01:49,400
and some of their origins are veiled in

28
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,840
the mists of the past.

29
00:01:51,980 --> 00:01:55,660
But their spirit and their meaning shine through

30
00:01:55,660 --> 00:01:59,940
the ages, never perhaps more brightly than now.

31
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:05,540
I have in sincerity pledged myself to your

32
00:02:05,540 --> 00:02:08,979
service, as so many of you are pledged

33
00:02:08,979 --> 00:02:09,660
to mine.

34
00:02:10,960 --> 00:02:14,300
Throughout all my life and with all my

35
00:02:14,300 --> 00:02:18,020
heart, I shall strive to be worthy of

36
00:02:18,020 --> 00:02:18,840
your trust.

37
00:02:21,080 --> 00:02:24,500
In this resolve, I have my husband to

38
00:02:24,500 --> 00:02:25,260
support me.

39
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:29,860
He shares all my ideals and all my

40
00:02:29,860 --> 00:02:31,040
affection for you.

41
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:36,840
Then, although my experience is so short and

42
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:40,520
my task so new, I have in my

43
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:44,860
parents and grandparents an example which I can

44
00:02:44,860 --> 00:02:48,240
follow with certainty and with confidence.

45
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:51,200
There is also this.

46
00:02:52,440 --> 00:02:56,080
I have behind me not only the splendid

47
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:59,360
traditions and the annals of more than a

48
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:04,180
thousand years, but the living strength and majesty

49
00:03:04,180 --> 00:03:09,520
of the commonwealth and empire, of societies old

50
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:14,160
and new, of lands and races different in

51
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:18,360
history and origins, but all by God's will

52
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:21,760
united in spirit and in aim.

53
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:28,300
Therefore, I am sure that this, my coronation,

54
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:31,860
is not the symbol of a power and

55
00:03:31,860 --> 00:03:35,960
a splendor that are gone, but a declaration

56
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:40,020
of our hopes for the future, and for

57
00:03:40,020 --> 00:03:43,220
the years I may, by God's grace and

58
00:03:43,220 --> 00:03:46,720
mercy, be given to reign and serve you

59
00:03:46,720 --> 00:03:47,780
as your queen.

60
00:03:50,630 --> 00:03:54,130
I have been speaking of the vast regions

61
00:03:54,130 --> 00:03:57,950
and varied peoples to whom I owe my

62
00:03:57,950 --> 00:04:01,970
duty, but there has also sprung from our

63
00:04:01,970 --> 00:04:06,310
island home a theme of social and political

64
00:04:06,310 --> 00:04:10,590
thought, which constitutes our message to the world

65
00:04:10,590 --> 00:04:16,070
and, through the changing generations, has found acceptance

66
00:04:16,070 --> 00:04:20,230
both within and far beyond my realms.

67
00:04:22,090 --> 00:04:27,370
Parliamentary institutions, with their free speech and respect

68
00:04:27,370 --> 00:04:31,710
for the rights of minorities and the inspiration

69
00:04:31,710 --> 00:04:35,910
of a broad tolerance in thought and its

70
00:04:35,910 --> 00:04:40,930
expression, all this we conceive to be a

71
00:04:40,930 --> 00:04:44,010
precious part of our way of life and

72
00:04:44,010 --> 00:04:44,590
outlook.

73
00:04:47,170 --> 00:04:52,390
During recent centuries, this message has been sustained

74
00:04:52,390 --> 00:04:57,750
and invigorated by the immense contribution in language,

75
00:04:58,430 --> 00:05:02,370
literature and action of the nations of our

76
00:05:02,370 --> 00:05:03,810
commonwealth overseas.

77
00:05:04,970 --> 00:05:09,110
It gives expression, as I pray it always

78
00:05:09,110 --> 00:05:13,570
will, to living principles as sacred to the

79
00:05:13,570 --> 00:05:17,690
crown and monarchy as to its many parliaments

80
00:05:17,690 --> 00:05:18,590
and peoples.

81
00:05:19,810 --> 00:05:24,250
I ask you now to cherish them and

82
00:05:24,250 --> 00:05:25,510
practice them too.

83
00:05:26,570 --> 00:05:30,590
Then we can go forward together in peace,

84
00:05:31,430 --> 00:05:34,590
seeking justice and freedom for all men.

85
00:05:37,160 --> 00:05:41,360
As this day draws to its close, I

86
00:05:41,360 --> 00:05:44,400
know that my abiding memory of it will

87
00:05:44,400 --> 00:05:48,900
be not only the solemnity and beauty of

88
00:05:48,900 --> 00:05:53,600
the ceremony, but the inspiration of your loyalty

89
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,920
and affection.

90
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:59,940
I thank you all from a full heart.

91
00:06:01,140 --> 00:06:03,120
God bless you all.
